<p>You rush toward your foe, readying your shot. If you reach the enemy, you release the shot, imbuing it with great power.</p><p>The shot does <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">153%, 175%, 192%, 207%, 220%</acronym> weapon damage and knocks back your target by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">1, 1, 2, 2, 2.</acronym></p><p>The cooldown of this talent is reduced by 1 each time you move.</p><p>This requires a sling to use.</p>